# canvas-app: soma-messages
# Demo-only parity UI, with native rich-link fixtures from the isolated API branch.
# Soma Messages linked to the Mac's iMessage service (0.6+). Against the service's DEMO on the Mac Pro: sample
# chats only, nothing of Boss's; every send gets a fake reply 2 s later. The harness must inject its ephemeral port/token; the checked-in endpoint fails closed.
shell cmd statusbar collapse
key HOME
# A clean start: not linked yet, no contacts answer.
shell pm clear dev.omalauncher.messages
# Contacts allowed ahead, so Android's prompt (whose title also says Allow) doesn't cover the inbox.
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.READ_CONTACTS
# 0.7+ asks for notifications when linked; granted here so its prompt does not cover the inbox.
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO
# Quoted twice: walk.py hands the line to the phone's shell, which would split the link at '&'.
shell am start -a android.intent.action.VIEW -d "'soma-messages://link?url=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A1&token=INJECT_EPHEMERAL_DEMO_TOKEN'" dev.omalauncher.messages
wait 2500
# The owner says yes to the Mac by name before anything goes to it.
expect Get your iMessages from 100.120.219.46?
shot link-dialog
tap Link
wait 1500
# Names come from the phone's contacts; the Mac's names stand in when the phone has none.
wait 4000
expect Weekend
expect Ana Demo
absent OpenBubbles
shot inbox-from-the-mac
# Guarded mutations on fresh synthetic own messages. The harness checks counts/history and rejects a sixth edit.
# Requires own DEMO fault proxy: first edit/replies/search request returns 503.
tap Ana Demo
tap Message
type RECOVER3-EDIT-ORIGINAL
key ENTER
wait 3000
expect RECOVER3-EDIT-ORIGINAL
closeime
doubletap RECOVER3-EDIT-ORIGINAL
shot eligible-message-actions card=messages-parity-edit-actions
tap Edit
replace "Edit message" RECOVER3-EDIT-RETRY
shot inline-edit card=messages-parity-inline-edit
tap Save edit
expect Injected DEMO edit refusal
expectexact RECOVER3-EDIT-RETRY
shot edit-failed-draft-kept card=messages-parity-edit-recovery
tap Save edit
expectexact RECOVER3-EDIT-RETRY
expect Edited
closeime
shot edit-retry-confirmed
tap Edit history for: RECOVER3-EDIT-RETRY
expect Edit history
expect RECOVER3-EDIT-ORIGINAL
expectexact RECOVER3-EDIT-RETRY
shot latest-edit-history card=messages-parity-edit-history
tap Done
tap Message
type RECOVER3-UNSEND-LATEST
key ENTER
wait 2500
closeime
doubletap RECOVER3-UNSEND-LATEST
tap Undo Send
expect You unsent a message
absentexact RECOVER3-UNSEND-LATEST
shot latest-unsent-notice card=messages-parity-unsent-notice
doubletap Demo reply to: RECOVER3-UNSEND-LATEST
tap Show replies
expect Injected DEMO replies refusal
shot thread-load-failed card=messages-parity-thread-recovery
tap Retry
expect Replies
expect Demo reply to: RECOVER3-UNSEND-LATEST
shot thread-retry-confirmed
key BACK
tap Message
type RECOVERY-PARENT-DRAFT
closeime
tap Search
tap Search in conversation
type RECOVER3
tap Find
expect Injected DEMO search refusal
keyboard hidden
shot search-failed card=messages-parity-search-recovery
tap Retry
expectexact RECOVER3-EDIT-RETRY
keyboard hidden
shot search-retry-confirmed
tap Clear search
tap Search in conversation
type needle
tap Find
expect 🧑🏽‍💻 café needle
keyboard hidden
shot unicode-search-result
tap Done searching
expect RECOVERY-PARENT-DRAFT
shot recovery-parent-preserved
